\pard\plain \tx0\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\ltrch\loch {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn walked out into the the warm evening air. In the summer the sun didn\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92t set until around seven so that would give her about an hour to make it home. Her funky night vision made driving in the dark a little scary. It was like everything was normal one minute and the next someone had turned up the brightness of the world so much that her vision went white.  Another symptom that had started after her fall.  Hopefully it would get better soon because the kids were begging for her to stay late and tuck them in. She really hated to disappoint them.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 As always Autumn had to parked a block away from Rainbow House in front of the church. There were always people coming and going from the building. The church was very involved with community including Rainbow House. In fact she had first met Reverend Adams and Reverend Thomas at the Holiday fund raiser for Rainbow house. The church had reached out to the press to draw more attention to the needs at the orphanage. And man did it work. Reverend Adams and Reverend Thomas had provided cookies for the bake sale. Between the press and the bake sale Rainbow house was able to raise more than enough money to get blankets and warm clothes for all the children.  Not to mention the anonymous donor who claimed he had seen the story on the news and wanted to brighten the holidays for the children.  With his extremely generous donation all the children had gifts under a very tall Christmas tree. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 After the drive home Autumn couldn\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92t wait to shower, slip into her PJs and curl up with a good book.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 When she walked through the front door she could hear the bass notes of Work by Rihanna coming from the bathroom. Which meant Vi was hitting the club tonight. Vi was a social butterfly in every way. Social because she made friends easily and  the butterfly part explained itself as Violet gave her best diva walk into the living room. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 What do you think Violet asked. Is it too naked or just naked enough?}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Her wavy ombre purple hair was slicked into a high pony and matched her electric lavender heels. When a girl had features like Vi she did not hide behind hair. Not to mention the thick thighs save lives that she was serving in her well fitted black and white floral romper. Her roomate was beautiful. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn had never felt beautiful in all of her twenty six years Cute maybe but not beautiful.  Her gray eyes were a little big for her face but her lashes were nice and thick.  Her dark coils would never slick down like Vi\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s. Instead Autumns hair was thick cluster of tight curls that did what the wanted. And if Autumn dared try to tame the locs with a slick back there would be hell to pay in the form of frizz.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 You look great. Not too naked. Autumn said heading toward her bedroom}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Thanks. Do you need help finding something to wear?}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 No Autumn replied. I know just the pair of comfy jammies Im looking for.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 No ma\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92am. No jammies.  You need a night out. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 A night in? Autumn said}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 No you need a night out. Come dance with me Vi said winder her hips to the beat. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Come on Autumn. It will be so much fun besides your are too young and beautiful to be in the house every weekend.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Vi you\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92re already dress and ready to go. I don\u8217\'92t want to hold you up.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Don\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92t even try it. It\u8217\'92s still early. Besides we need to eat before we leave.  Drinking on an empty stomach is not a good look.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 It had been about six months since she had gone out. She would have to shake the dust off he club clothes but it would be fun to go out dancing with her bestie.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 OK I\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92ll go. }
