\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Suddenly she felt a tingle down her back as if someone had caressed her. She turned around looking for the asshole who tried to cop a feel but no one was there.  Still she felt something.}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8220\'93Autumn?\u8221\'94 Vi called of the music. You ok?}
