\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn just needed a moment to shake of the feeling that she was being watched. She just needed to get some air.  Autumn had almost made her way to the side when she hit a brick wall and stumbled backward. Her heels rolled and she braced for a humiliating fall. The crash never came. In a blink she was pulled forward and pressed against the brick wall again. But this time she felt a hand against her spine and a tingle started to spread through her whole body. }
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i0  His dark wavy hair fell in front of his eyes like a curtain. But beyond that wavy veil were the most seductive he was starring at her.  His eye seemed to glow for just a second probably from the club lights.}
